## Why Christmas Character Nails Are the Look of the Season

Character nails used to mean picking one motif and running with it for the season. That is shifting. These three characters, gingerbread, santa, and gnome, are increasingly showing up together on the same hand rather than staying siloed into separate single-motif sets. A gnome accent nail next to a santa hat french tip is not a compromise between two ideas. It is the actual look people are asking for.

