## Santa Nail Ideas (Including the Santa Hat French Tip Everyone's Wearing)

You do not need to paint a face to do santa nails. The santa hat french tip and the santa belt accent are both shape-based techniques, built from angles and lines rather than freehand features, so there is genuinely nothing here that requires drawing skill.

The santa hat french tip takes the standard french manicure and reshapes the white tip into a soft red triangle, capped with a small white pom-pom dot at the peak. It reads instantly as "santa" without a single facial detail. This is the single most-searched santa nail technique this season, and for good reason: it works on almond and stiletto shapes especially well, since the longer tip gives the triangle enough room to sit properly instead of looking cramped.


