## Best Nail Shapes and Lengths for Character Nail Art

**Almond and square shapes suit character nail art best, since both offer a flatter, wider canvas that holds fine detail without distorting the design.** Stiletto and coffin work well specifically for the santa hat french tip, where the extra length gives the triangle tip room to sit properly.

