Short nails are not excluded here. Gingerbread's icing swirl and gnome's silhouette stamp both compress cleanly onto a shorter nail bed since neither depends on length, only surface space. Santa's hat french tip is the one design that benefits most from extra length, so if your nails run short, lean the santa look toward the belt accent instead of the tip version, and save the hat for a longer set later in the season.

